43. RESULT:
In the result,
i) The appeal of Claimants is partly allowed;
(2015) 1 SCC 539 (2021) 6 SCC 188 (2021) 2 SCC 166 ii) The claimants are granted enhanced compensation of Rs.76,10,554/- as just and fair, with interest @ 9% per annum thereon from the date of claim petition till realization;
iii) The respondent No.3 - Insurance Company shall deposit the amount as aforesaid,
adjusting the amount already deposited if any, before the Tribunal within one month;
iv) The cost throughout is awarded to the claimants/appellants against the respondents to be paid by the insurance company.

